{"seq":2,"slug":"quantitative-methods","title":"博士 法学研究方法 — 法律量化分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/law/legal-scholarship/data-and-analysis/quantitative-methods","wordCount":2169,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"博士-法学研究方法-法律量化分析\">博士 法学研究方法 — 法律量化分析</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>法律量化分析（quantitative legal analysis）是将统计方法和计量技术系统性地应用于法律现象研究的方法论体系。其核心假设是法律运作中存在可量化的规律性模式，可以通过对大量观察值的统计分析加以识别和验证。在英美法学界，这一传统可以追溯到 Oliver Wendell Holmes 的名言&quot;法律的生命不在于逻辑，而在于经验&quot;，法律量化分析正是将这种经验主义精神推向了方法论的系统化。在中国，随着裁判文书网数据的大规模开放以及社会科学方法训练的普及，法律量化研究正在从边缘走向主流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"回归分析在司法研究中的应用\">回归分析在司法研究中的应用</h3><p>回归分析是法律量化研究中最常用的工具。其基本形式是线性回归模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y = \\beta_0 + \\beta_1 X_1 + \\beta_2 X_2 + \\cdots + \\beta_k X_k + \\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span> 是因变量（如量刑结果、胜诉率），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_1, X_2, \\ldots, X_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是自变量（如案件事实特征、当事人属性、法官背景），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 是误差项。</p>\n<p>在司法决策研究中，研究者通常关心的是在控制其他变量后，某个特定因素对裁判结果的净效应。例如，Steffensmeier 和 Demuth (2000) 的经典研究通过 logistic 回归分析发现，在控制犯罪严重性、前科记录和案件类型后，被告的种族仍然对联邦法院的量刑决定具有统计显著的影响。</p>\n<p>法律量化研究中常用的回归模型类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因变量类型</th>\n<th>适用模型</th>\n<th>法学应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>连续变量</td>\n<td>OLS 线性回归</td>\n<td>量刑月数、损害赔偿金额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二分变量</td>\n<td>Logistic 回归</td>\n<td>胜诉/败诉、有罪/无罪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有序分类</td>\n<td>有序 Logit/Probit</td>\n<td>刑罚等级、严重程度评级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计数变量</td>\n<td>Poisson/负二项回归</td>\n<td>上诉次数、引证频次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删失数据</td>\n<td>生存分析（Cox 模型）</td>\n<td>案件审理时长、缓刑期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"因果推断与内生性问题\">因果推断与内生性问题</h3><p>法律量化研究面临的最大方法论挑战是因果推断。法律现象中的自变量很少是随机分配的——例如，当事人是否聘请律师与其经济条件相关，而经济条件本身也可能影响案件结果。这种内生性（endogeneity）问题使得回归系数的因果解释变得困难。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    X[自变量:是否有律师] --&gt; Y[因变量:胜诉率]&#10;    Z[混淆变量:经济条件] --&gt; X&#10;    Z --&gt; Y&#10;    IV[工具变量:法律援助资格线] -.-&gt; X\">flowchart TD\n    X[自变量:是否有律师] --&gt; Y[因变量:胜诉率]\n    Z[混淆变量:经济条件] --&gt; X\n    Z --&gt; Y\n    IV[工具变量:法律援助资格线] -.-&gt; X</pre><p>处理内生性的主要技术包括：</p>\n<p><strong>工具变量法</strong>（Instrumental Variables, IV）：寻找一个与内生自变量相关但不直接影响因变量的工具变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span>，通过两阶段最小二乘法（2SLS）估计因果效应。在法学研究中，政策变动的时间节点、地理管辖边界和法定资格线都是常用的工具变量来源。</p>\n<p><strong>断点回归设计</strong>（Regression Discontinuity Design, RDD）：利用某个连续变量在特定阈值处的跳跃来识别因果效应。例如，Kling (2006) 利用法官随机分配机制作为一种自然实验，研究入狱对被告后续就业的因果影响。</p>\n<p><strong>双重差分法</strong>（Difference-in-Differences, DID）：比较政策实施前后、实施地区与未实施地区之间的差异变化。这在评估法律改革效果的研究中极为常用：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{DID} = (\\bar{Y}_{treat,post} - \\bar{Y}_{treat,pre}) - (\\bar{Y}_{control,post} - \\bar{Y}_{control,pre})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"引证网络分析\">引证网络分析</h3><p>法律引证网络分析（citation network analysis）将图论和网络科学的方法引入法学研究，以法律文本（判例、法规、学术文献）为节点、引用关系为边，构建有向网络，揭示法律体系的结构特征。</p>\n<p>核心指标包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>入度</strong>（in-degree）：一个节点被引次数，衡量其权威性</li>\n<li><strong>出度</strong>（out-degree）：一个节点引用他人的次数，衡量其对既有知识的依赖程度</li>\n<li><strong>中介中心性</strong>（betweenness centrality）：衡量一个节点在连接不同法律领域之间的桥梁作用</li>\n<li><strong>PageRank</strong>：借鉴网页排序算法，通过迭代计算综合权威度</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fowler 等人 (2007) 的开创性工作将引证网络分析应用于美国最高法院判例，发现最具网络中心性的判例往往是宪法领域的里程碑判决（如 <em>Brown v. Board of Education</em>、<em>Roe v. Wade</em>），其影响力远超单纯的被引次数所能反映的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;Marbury v. Madison&lt;br/&gt;(1803)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;McCulloch v. Maryland&lt;br/&gt;(1819)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Brown v. Board&lt;br/&gt;(1954)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;Gibbons v. Ogden&lt;br/&gt;(1824)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;Roe v. Wade&lt;br/&gt;(1973)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;Loving v. Virginia&lt;br/&gt;(1967)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;Planned Parenthood v. Casey&lt;br/&gt;(1992)&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;Wickard v. Filburn&lt;br/&gt;(1942)&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"Marbury v. Madison&lt;br/&gt;(1803)\"] --&gt; B[\"McCulloch v. Maryland&lt;br/&gt;(1819)\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Brown v. Board&lt;br/&gt;(1954)\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"Gibbons v. Ogden&lt;br/&gt;(1824)\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"Roe v. Wade&lt;br/&gt;(1973)\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"Loving v. Virginia&lt;br/&gt;(1967)\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"Planned Parenthood v. Casey&lt;br/&gt;(1992)\"]\n    F --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; H[\"Wickard v. Filburn&lt;br/&gt;(1942)\"]</pre><h3 id=\"法律量化研究的效度与局限\">法律量化研究的效度与局限</h3><p>法律量化研究的效度依赖于以下条件的满足：</p>\n<p><strong>内部效度</strong>：回归模型是否正确识别了因果关系。遗漏变量偏误、反向因果、选择偏差都会威胁内部效度。</p>\n<p><strong>外部效度</strong>：研究结果是否可以推广到其他法域、时间段或案件类型。法律制度的高度地方性使得外部效度成为法律量化研究的固有弱点。</p>\n<p><strong>构念效度</strong>：操作化指标是否准确捕捉了理论概念。例如，用量刑月数衡量&quot;刑罚严厉程度&quot;是否充分——它没有捕捉到缓刑、罚金、社区服务等替代性制裁。</p>\n<p><strong>生态效度</strong>：统计模型中的变量关系是否反映了法律实践中的真实决策过程。法官在判决时考虑的因素远比回归模型中的变量复杂，且很多考量难以量化。</p>\n<p>法律量化研究的批评者（如 Epstein &amp; King 2002 的尖锐批评）指出，许多法学领域的&quot;实证研究&quot;在方法论上远未达到社会科学的基本标准。这一批评促使法学界开始更加严肃地对待研究设计和统计推断问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>在中国裁判文书网上检索某一类案件（如危险驾驶罪或离婚纠纷）的裁判文书，从中提取至少 50 个案例的关键变量（量刑/判决结果、案件事实特征等），尝试构建一个简单的回归模型。你面临了哪些操作化和编码上的困难？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>假设你想研究&quot;法律援助是否提高了刑事被告的辩护效果&quot;，请设计一个利用工具变量或断点回归的研究方案。你选择的工具变量或断点是什么？它满足相关性和排他性条件吗？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>选择一个法学领域（如知识产权、环境法），利用北大法宝或 HeinOnline 的引证数据，尝试绘制一个小型引证网络（10-20 个核心案例或文献），分析哪些节点具有最高的中心性。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>阅读 Epstein 和 King (2002) &quot;The Rules of Inference&quot; 一文的摘要和引言，思考：他们对法学实证研究的批评是否也适用于中国法学界？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Epstein, Lee &amp; Andrew D. Martin</strong> <em>An Introduction to Empirical Legal Research</em> (OUP, 2014) — 法学实证研究方法的入门教科书，系统介绍了从研究设计到统计分析的全流程。</li>\n<li><strong>Angrist, Joshua D. &amp; Jörn-Steffen Pischke</strong> <em>Mostly Harmless Econometrics</em> (Princeton UP, 2009) — 计量经济学因果推断方法的经典教材，其中的 IV、RDD、DID 方法广泛应用于法律量化研究。</li>\n<li><strong>Fowler, James H. et al.</strong> &quot;Network Analysis and the Law&quot; (2007) 15 <em>Journal of Legal Studies</em> — 引证网络分析在法学中应用的开创性论文。</li>\n<li><strong>白建军</strong>《法律实证研究方法》（北京大学出版社）——中国法学量化分析的系统性著作，结合中国司法数据案例。</li>\n<li><strong>程金华</strong>《中国法律的实证研究》（北京大学出版社）——综合多种实证方法分析中国法律制度的运作。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>法律量化分析为法学研究提供了从统计角度理解法律现象的系统工具。回归分析是核心技术，但因果推断的方法论挑战——特别是内生性问题——要求研究者掌握工具变量、断点回归和双重差分等高级技术。引证网络分析则从结构视角揭示了法律体系的知识网络特征。任何量化分析的价值都取决于研究设计的质量：变量的操作化是否准确、模型设定是否恰当、结论的推广边界是否清晰。量化方法不是法学研究的万能钥匙，但对于那些涉及大量观察值和可量化变量的法律问题，它提供了教义分析无法替代的认识论优势。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博士 法学研究方法 — 法律量化分析","id":"博士-法学研究方法-法律量化分析"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"回归分析在司法研究中的应用","id":"回归分析在司法研究中的应用"},{"level":3,"text":"因果推断与内生性问题","id":"因果推断与内生性问题"},{"level":3,"text":"引证网络分析","id":"引证网络分析"},{"level":3,"text":"法律量化研究的效度与局限","id":"法律量化研究的效度与局限"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"博士 法学研究方法 — 法律文本与判例分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/law/legal-scholarship/data-and-analysis/legal-sources"},"next":{"title":"博士 法学研究方法 — 交叉学科方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/law/legal-scholarship/data-and-analysis/interdisciplinary-methods"}}